    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you done with navigating randomly generated labyrinths? Are you sick of getting stuck with horrible layouts, unrewarding chambers, and frustrating situations you had no choice in receiving? The suffering ends here! In this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a high performance labyrinth generator and create your own custom-built battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a treadless tank into your creation and clear it of hostile forces to get money. Ensure you satisfy the rising bounty in order to progress through the rounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard-earned cash to purchase new chambers with new enemies and unique layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and interact with exchange units to purchase new weapons, tools, and upgrades. Customize your equipment to your heart's content!.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to become the ultimate Tank Buster!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you done with navigating randomly generated labyrinths? Are you sick of getting stuck with horrible layouts, unrewarding chambers, and frustrating situations you had no choice in receiving? The suffering ends here! In this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a high performance labyrinth generator and create your own custom-built battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a treadless tank into your creation and clear it of hostile forces to get money. Ensure you satisfy the rising bounty in order to progress through the rounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard-earned cash to purchase new chambers with new enemies and unique layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and interact with exchange units to purchase new weapons, tools, and upgrades. Customize your equipment to your heart's content!.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to become the ultimate Tank Buster!</p>",
    "short_description": "Sci-Fi arena building tank combat game. Build an arena to maximize your chances of survival and profit, then fight your way through the arena and reach the end.",
